  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;.SF UI Text&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;.SFUIText&quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"></span><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">29日に、舞台「マギアレコード&nbsp;魔法少女まどか☆マギカ外伝」見に行ってきました~♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">メンバー10人が舞台をやると決まって、絶対に見に行きたい！と思ってたからずっと必死に勉強してました✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">アニメ「魔法少女まどか☆マギカ」も見たし、ゲームもやり始めたし</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">でも、ゲームをやってて、オーディションの時に使った台本のセリフが出てきて</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あ！ここのシーン！って勝手に1人でなってたり…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">すごくマギレコにハマりました💫</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">だから、今回この舞台を見れて本当に良かったです✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">稽古期間中、なかなかメンバーに会えなくて</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">どんな事をしたのかとか全然知らないで舞台を見たら、本当に皆頑張ったんだなとすごく伝わってきました。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当に一人一人すごくて、言い出したら止まらないくらい感動しました。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">涙が出そうになって、舞台中は堪えちゃったけど、終演後のメンバーを見て、また涙が出そうになってしまいました(T^T)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当に本当に良かったです！！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この舞台を作り上げるのに、皆が頑張ってきたことが本当に目に見えてくるし</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">誇らしいです⸜(*˙꒳˙*)⸝</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当に自慢の10人だと思います✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">残りの公演も頑張ってください！！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私も頑張らなきゃな~💫</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また、必ず見に行きます⸜(*˙꒳˙*)⸝</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">*☼*―――――*☼*―――――</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本日発売の月刊エンタメさんに</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">井口眞緒さん×高瀬愛奈さん×小坂菜緒×宮田愛萌のインタビューと撮り下しの写真が掲載されています！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なかなか無い組み合わせでのインタビューだったのでとっても楽しかったです✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">4人でたくさんお話してきたので、是非見てみてください！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-08-31/26132_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_3982.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255,